<p>Pope Leo XIV used his first Easter Mass and Urbi et Orbi blessing as pontiff at the Vatican on Sunday to urge political leaders to end wars through dialogue, telling those with the power to start conflicts to “choose peace”. Across the coverage, outlets said Leo cast Easter’s message of resurrection as a reason for hope while warning that the world is growing used to violence and increasingly indifferent to the suffering and wider consequences of war. His appeal came as Christians celebrated Easter around the world and as fighting continued in Ukraine, Myanmar, Sudan, and the Middle East, with several reports also noting tensions involving Iran, the United States, and Israel. The moment carried extra symbolic weight because it was Leo’s first Easter as pope, and because some reports linked his words to the late Pope Francis, whose warnings about indifference to human suffering echoed in Leo’s message.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/WeOKEyM0V6ta0m9uB6X44-ThzC5yJoOH89HzlBt1To-qkTMBJLfcJ5wl7zTWLpUQNam_HeKzyWi0MReCgcH9Ofl5kLGWsG0LO_16vuaEZAE5FPN6vBHRbObqyN6Oe9Gw-UiUg7968lOFEr6XS4Omoh_0Oy7ic_dBAi06OPt40g' alt='Pope Leo XIV during his first Easter appearance as pontiff at the Vatican' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>American first: Several outlets highlighted that Leo is the first pope from the United States, making the address an early test of how his papacy will speak to conflicts involving both global powers and his home country.</li><li>Home-country complication: CBS’s video report said the peace appeal came amid “an American war in Iran,” giving Leo’s message an immediate dimension at home as well as abroad.</li><li>Francis tribute: The Hindu reported that Leo paid tribute to Pope Francis, who last appeared in public on Easter Sunday the previous year, only hours before his death.</li><li>Lay down arms: Beyond asking leaders to “choose peace,” PBS and Politico noted that Leo also appealed directly to those holding weapons, urging them to lay them down.</li></ul><blockquote>Let those who have the power to unleash wars choose peace! Not a peace imposed by force, but through dialogue! Not with the desire to dominate others, but to encounter them! - Pope Leo XIV</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Semafor: Semafor highlighted Leo’s warning that people are becoming “accustomed to violence,” treating the address as both a warning about moral desensitization to war and a plea for diplomacy. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/04/05/2026/pope-leo-xiv-calls-for-peace-in-easter-address'>Semafor</a>)</li><li>Politico Europe: The outlet saw Leo’s address as a rebuke to the violence and aggressive rhetoric surrounding the Middle East escalation, even though he did not single out any leader by name. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/choose-peace-pope-leo-world-leaders-easter-address/'>Politico Europe</a>)</li><li>CBS News: CBS framed the address around hope, emphasizing Leo’s effort to offer reassurance against a backdrop of global conflict. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/pope-leo-calls-for-hope-amid-confilcts-first-easter/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>The Hindu: The Hindu highlighted the commemorative side of the day, tying Leo’s tribute to Francis to the broader shadow cast by war in West Asia. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/choose-peace-says-pope-leo-first-easter-wishes-war-in-west-asia/article70827518.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/pope-leo-calls-for-hope-amid-confilcts-first-easter/'>Pope Leo calls for hope amid global conflicts on his first Easter as pontiff</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/pope-leo-xiv-calls-for-peace-in-first-easter-mass-as-pontiff-as-christians-celebrate-worldwide'>Pope Leo XIV calls for peace in first Easter Mass as pontiff as Christians celebrate worldwide</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/choose-peace-pope-leo-world-leaders-easter-address/'>‘Choose peace,’ Pope Leo implores world leaders in first Easter address</a> - politico.eu</li><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/04/05/2026/pope-leo-xiv-calls-for-peace-in-easter-address'>Pope Leo XIV calls for peace in first Easter address</a> - semafor.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/05/in-first-easter-blessing-as-pontiff-pope-leo-xiv-urges-those-who-can-unleash-wars-to-choos'>In first Easter blessing as pontiff, Pope Leo XIV urges those who can unleash wars to &#x27;choose peace&#x27;</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/5/pope-warns-world-is-becoming-indifferent-to-violence'>Pope warns world is becoming ‘indifferent’ to violence</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/choose-peace-says-pope-leo-first-easter-wishes-war-in-west-asia/article70827518.ece'>‘Choose peace’: Pope Leo XIV marks first Easter under cloud of war in West Asia</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/pope-leo-marks-easter-pontiff-call-hope-amid-131740375'>Pope Leo marks first Easter as pontiff with call for hope amid global conflicts</a> - abcnews.com</li></ul>